WEBVTT

00:12.790 --> 00:15.890
It's been three days and you still haven't found her?

00:15.890 --> 00:19.970
So now you're making excuses, Chief?

00:19.970 --> 00:20.900
All right.

00:20.900 --> 00:22.730
Please do hurry and get results as soon as possible.

00:24.640 --> 00:26.400
What a troublesome girl.

00:28.410 --> 00:29.870
I'm sorry, Mother.

00:34.650 --> 00:36.410
Hello, it's me.

00:36.410 --> 00:38.210
Add a thousand more posters.

00:40.520 --> 00:43.750
Himeno, where have you gone?

00:47.890 --> 00:48.760
Just my imagination...

00:59.500 --> 01:02.000
"Glad Sasame didn't show up," right?

01:04.310 --> 01:09.710
I can understand you don't want to fight him, but now, he's our enemy.

01:09.710 --> 01:12.620
Being soft on him will cause confusion. It's dangerous.

01:13.590 --> 01:15.550
Yeah, I know.

01:16.490 --> 01:17.960
I have to be strong!

01:18.680 --> 01:21.950
The boundless future stretches across the skies

01:18.680 --> 01:21.950
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

01:21.950 --> 01:25.990
And I am reborn anew

01:21.950 --> 01:25.990
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

01:25.990 --> 01:33.010
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

01:25.990 --> 01:33.010
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

01:37.190 --> 01:37.390
Prétear

01:45.240 --> 01:52.150
Destiny is there to be grasped, so stretch out your hands

01:45.240 --> 01:52.150
unmei wa tsukamu mono kono te jiyuu ni nobaseba ii

01:52.150 --> 01:56.940
There is no tomorrow which has already been decided

01:52.150 --> 01:56.940
kimerareta ashita wa nai

01:58.990 --> 02:05.890
Even if you say nothing, I know our meeting that day was no coincidence

01:58.990 --> 02:05.890
damatte ite mo wakaru ano hi deai wa guuzen janai

02:05.890 --> 02:10.800
I sensed eternity in your distant gaze

02:05.890 --> 02:10.800
tooi hitomi ni eien kanjita

02:12.630 --> 02:16.500
The light of the setting sun is beautiful

02:12.630 --> 02:16.500
kurete yuku yuuhi ga kirei

02:16.500 --> 02:19.640
If the cold wind glimmers

02:16.500 --> 02:19.640
tsumetai kaze ga hikareba

02:19.640 --> 02:25.410
I can hear your voice drifting gently

02:19.640 --> 02:25.410
anata no koe sotto kikoeteru

02:25.580 --> 02:25.880
Knowing that I'm not alone in my heart

02:25.580 --> 02:30.350
kokoro no naka hitori janai koto itai hodo

02:30.350 --> 02:32.890
Warms it so much that it hurts

02:30.350 --> 02:32.890
kono mune o atsuku suru

02:32.890 --> 02:35.620
It all begins from the point of believing

02:32.890 --> 02:35.620
hajimaru ne shinjiru koto kara

02:35.620 --> 02:39.290
These feelings are proof of being alive

02:35.620 --> 02:39.290
kono kimochi ikiru akashi

02:39.290 --> 02:39.590
The endless future and the expanding skies

02:39.290 --> 02:42.500
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

02:42.500 --> 02:46.530
Allow me to be reborn anew

02:42.500 --> 02:46.530
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

02:46.530 --> 02:52.640
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

02:46.530 --> 02:52.640
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

02:52.640 --> 02:57.240
Holding hands with you

02:52.640 --> 02:59.240
sono te tsunaide

02:59.420 --> 03:02.880
Eyes of Glass

03:04.700 --> 03:07.700
What a pathetic father I am.

03:07.700 --> 03:11.200
I don't know what to do at all at a time like this.

03:11.200 --> 03:13.070
Not even for another daughter either.

03:26.150 --> 03:28.490
Mawata, it's me.

03:28.490 --> 03:32.690
Well, I thought maybe we could drink tea together once in a while.

03:32.690 --> 03:34.520
Mawata? I'm coming in.

03:37.360 --> 03:39.660
Could you undo the lock?

03:44.040 --> 03:45.300
I'll come again later.

03:50.640 --> 03:53.210
<i>Now, let's look at a postcard.</i>

03:53.210 --> 03:57.520
<i>From Miss Silk. She always sends us request postcards.</i>

03:57.520 --> 03:59.950
<i>She's a fourteen year old in junior high school.</i>

03:59.950 --> 04:01.550
<i>I wonder what she's asking today?</i>

04:01.550 --> 04:04.490
<i>"There's something I think often recently..."</i>

04:04.490 --> 04:05.960
Sasame...

04:07.690 --> 04:10.300
Miss Mayune...

04:10.300 --> 04:13.430
Do I really have to go?

04:13.430 --> 04:14.600
I'll reveal it.

04:14.600 --> 04:16.740
What?! What will you reveal?

04:16.740 --> 04:18.100
Everything!

04:18.100 --> 04:20.040
What exactly do you know...

04:20.040 --> 04:21.210
Everything!

04:21.210 --> 04:22.900
Than you know about that?!

04:23.540 --> 04:25.910
Of course I do! I'll reveal especially that!

04:25.910 --> 04:28.780
Oh, please don't! Anything but that!

04:28.780 --> 04:30.940
I'm going, I'm going!

04:40.190 --> 04:42.160
Perfect!

04:42.160 --> 04:46.700
With this Mayune's Special Himeno Roach Motel, there's no need to search for her!

04:46.700 --> 04:48.800
Tanaka, make two hundred more of these!

04:48.800 --> 04:51.740
More importantly, Miss, please don't say anything about that.

04:51.740 --> 04:52.800
About what?

04:52.800 --> 04:53.610
Well...

04:53.610 --> 04:54.970
Did you really have something?!

04:56.040 --> 04:58.030
I'll immediately go make two hundred of these!

05:09.090 --> 05:12.720
The grounds are frozen from the blue moonlight.

05:13.690 --> 05:15.060
Sasame?

05:15.060 --> 05:17.630
Even if everything in the world loses its color,

05:17.630 --> 05:23.160
...I will not lose sight of you, my beloved princess radiating the color of darkness.

05:24.000 --> 05:25.770
You're such a poet.

05:27.910 --> 05:29.510
Do you understand?

05:29.510 --> 05:32.940
I'm the Princess of Disaster who seizes Leafe and sends the world on the path of death.

05:32.940 --> 05:35.380
I'm using you for that purpose.

05:36.010 --> 05:37.480
I understand.

05:37.480 --> 05:41.290
I'd rather be a fool than to lie to myself.

05:41.290 --> 05:45.420
I'm here on my own free will, near you.

05:46.890 --> 05:47.980
What a dumb person.

06:06.480 --> 06:07.640
Can't sleep?

06:08.650 --> 06:09.650
Hayate...

06:09.650 --> 06:11.480
If you don't sleep, you're not going to last.

06:11.480 --> 06:13.590
Yeah, I know.

06:13.590 --> 06:15.640
But for some reason, my eyes are wide open.

06:29.230 --> 06:30.170
Sorry.

06:32.100 --> 06:35.010
I'm making you go through all sorts of difficult things.

06:35.010 --> 06:38.480
You've separated yourself from your family, and even from Sasame.

06:38.480 --> 06:39.180
I...

06:39.180 --> 06:40.410
Are you regretting it?

06:41.480 --> 06:46.640
Are you regretting making me into a Prétear, meeting me?

06:47.550 --> 06:50.360
I don't have any regrets.

06:50.360 --> 06:54.960
I'm glad I became a Prétear, because, we were able to meet.

06:57.200 --> 07:01.230
We searched for a Prétear, and then I found you.

07:01.230 --> 07:04.400
In this entire world, I found you!

07:04.400 --> 07:05.700
Hayate...

07:05.700 --> 07:10.570
I found you!

07:18.880 --> 07:20.250
Well...

07:20.790 --> 07:22.650
Looks like the wind's blowing.

07:25.190 --> 07:27.850
It's getting cold. Let's go back.

07:32.400 --> 07:34.160
You're so nice, Hayate.

07:39.600 --> 07:43.560
Even that time, because Hayate had come, I...

07:49.480 --> 07:50.810
Himeno?

07:54.050 --> 07:56.150
I should have talked to her more.

07:56.890 --> 07:57.950
Mawata...

08:10.700 --> 08:13.270
<i>Now, let's look at a postcard.</i>

08:13.270 --> 08:15.170
<i>From Miss Silk...</i>

08:15.170 --> 08:16.570
Kaoru!

08:16.570 --> 08:19.480
The police have some information concerning Himeno!

08:19.480 --> 08:20.680
Really?

08:20.680 --> 08:22.580
I'll go to the police station immediately!

08:22.580 --> 08:23.600
Wait, me too.

08:25.250 --> 08:26.740
Kaoru! You're drenched!

08:27.290 --> 08:31.350
The love you lost won't come back, so you should hate.

08:35.690 --> 08:38.160
Sasame, help me...

08:41.000 --> 08:42.160
If you need Leafe...

08:44.240 --> 08:47.500
iya uso demo ii

08:44.240 --> 08:47.500
No, I don't care if it's a lie

08:44.240 --> 08:46.100
Take it from me.

08:46.100 --> 08:47.500
Sasame...

08:48.340 --> 08:51.210
If I do that, you'll disintegrate.

08:49.810 --> 08:54.250
kimi ga kami wo toki

08:49.810 --> 08:54.250
You combing my hair

08:51.210 --> 08:53.040
Are you all right with that?

08:53.040 --> 08:55.010
I don't care.

08:55.450 --> 09:05.120
boku no kuchibiru wo <i>kiss</i> de fusagu nara

08:55.450 --> 09:05.120
If you'll smother my lips with a kiss

08:56.850 --> 08:59.580
As long as I'm able to satisfy you.

09:02.420 --> 09:05.590
I don't love you.

09:05.590 --> 09:06.690
I don't care.

09:06.690 --> 09:16.500
kodomo nano wa aa boku no housa

09:06.690 --> 09:16.500
I'm the one who's the child

09:06.690 --> 09:10.900
If you loved me that much, why didn't you say anything?

09:10.900 --> 09:12.030
Why?

09:12.730 --> 09:18.900
If you had said so to me, I might not have become the Princess of Disaster.

09:16.500 --> 09:22.270
hoka no koto wa mou yokute

09:16.500 --> 09:22.270
Other things no longer matter

09:18.900 --> 09:21.410
You were in love with Hayate.

09:21.410 --> 09:24.480
Had I said how I felt about you, I might have made you suffer.

09:22.270 --> 09:27.580
kimochi wo tomerarenai

09:22.270 --> 09:27.580
I can't stop how I feel

09:24.480 --> 09:27.580
You couldn't have known unless you told me!

09:27.580 --> 09:31.180
You're right, but I do know one thing for certain.

09:28.980 --> 09:38.990
ai wa koete yuku taiyou mo hoshizora mo

09:28.980 --> 09:38.990
Love will go over even the sun and the stars

09:31.180 --> 09:33.380
Even though you've become the Princess of Disaster,

09:33.380 --> 09:35.150
...my feelings for you won't change.

09:38.990 --> 09:45.700
hohoemu kimi dake no naka ni aru

09:38.990 --> 09:45.700
It's only inside you as you smile

09:45.700 --> 09:49.900
Get lost! Out of my sight, now!

09:47.730 --> 09:52.070
kirameki ni toketeku

09:47.730 --> 09:52.070
It melts and blends with a sparkle

09:49.900 --> 09:52.070
If that's what you desire...

09:52.070 --> 09:56.440
soshite kowashiteku

09:52.070 --> 09:56.440
Then it is destroyed

09:56.440 --> 10:01.880
yuujyou no kakera sae

09:56.440 --> 10:01.880
Not even a shard of friendship, not even the love

10:01.880 --> 10:13.250
dareka ga kono boku he shinobaseta ai saemo

10:01.880 --> 10:13.250
Even the love of someone who loved me secretly

10:11.190 --> 10:13.250
Sasame...

10:19.530 --> 10:23.970
I'm here to grant your wishes.

10:25.500 --> 10:27.240
Mawata?

10:27.240 --> 10:29.710
She's in her room.

10:29.710 --> 10:32.480
Well, I haven't seen her at all lately.

10:32.480 --> 10:34.180
There might be something wrong.

10:34.180 --> 10:35.580
Such as?

10:35.580 --> 10:36.980
Problems causing distress.

10:36.980 --> 10:38.780
Oh, she's all right!

10:38.780 --> 10:41.290
She's really got it together.

10:41.290 --> 10:42.780
She's been like that since forever.

10:44.190 --> 10:49.890
Mother! Father promised we'd go boating together!

10:49.890 --> 10:54.060
Hey, Father will return, won't he?

10:55.330 --> 10:57.360
Liar!

10:58.800 --> 11:00.570
Big fat liar!

11:00.570 --> 11:04.030
It's all right, Mother. I'm with you.

11:05.680 --> 11:11.480
Sister, when Mother's feeling better, let's all go boating together.

11:11.480 --> 11:13.850
So don't cry.

11:22.590 --> 11:26.290
She's a nice girl. She cares for others.

11:27.300 --> 11:29.060
That's why I'm worried.

11:30.170 --> 11:34.670
I hope she hasn't hurt herself by worrying about others' feelings.

11:34.670 --> 11:37.140
<i>She's a fourteen year old in junior high school.</i>

11:37.140 --> 11:38.300
<i>I wonder what she's asking today?</i>

11:45.680 --> 11:51.490
"Everything around me seems to be objects from another dimension...

11:51.490 --> 11:55.690
...and I can't seem to freely accept what's right in front of me."

11:57.330 --> 12:00.000
This is the second time we've met, Miss Silk.

12:00.000 --> 12:03.160
Or should I say, Miss Mawata.

12:05.440 --> 12:06.560
<i>Beyondios!</i>

12:19.720 --> 12:22.650
Water Flail!

12:32.800 --> 12:33.760
This is...

12:35.900 --> 12:38.600
Himeno, that was a brilliant fight.

12:39.570 --> 12:41.800
It seems as though you've begun to relax a little as well.

12:42.440 --> 12:44.910
That's because you're all here.

12:45.640 --> 12:48.080
It would be great if you could live alone.

12:48.080 --> 12:53.240
If you are alone, you won't hurt anyone, nor will you get hurt.

12:54.950 --> 12:57.090
It would be great if you could live alone.

12:57.090 --> 13:00.890
You won't hurt anyone, nor will you get hurt.

13:00.890 --> 13:02.990
It would be great if you could live alone.

13:07.870 --> 13:09.130
I don't want to be alone...

13:09.770 --> 13:13.170
Why didn't I realize this about her sooner?

13:13.170 --> 13:14.340
Himeno?

13:14.340 --> 13:16.140
Not feeling well or something?

13:16.970 --> 13:18.240
I have to go back to the house!

13:18.240 --> 13:20.480
Put number 180 in the back yard.

13:20.480 --> 13:23.950
Put numbers 190 to 200 over there.

13:23.950 --> 13:25.650
Okay, now I can relax a little.

13:25.650 --> 13:26.380
Tanaka!

13:26.380 --> 13:27.990
Miss!

13:27.990 --> 13:29.290
Why are you at ease?

13:29.290 --> 13:31.490
Well, that is...

13:31.490 --> 13:32.790
Oh, Miss, someone's...

13:32.790 --> 13:33.890
Don't try to change the subject!

13:33.890 --> 13:34.950
No, really.

13:38.130 --> 13:40.300
My! What is that?!

13:40.300 --> 13:42.230
Hey, you! What business have you got here?!

13:42.230 --> 13:43.760
This is not a cosplay auditoriu...

13:44.340 --> 13:45.670
Hey!

13:56.280 --> 13:58.180
Just what heck is this thing?!

13:59.180 --> 14:01.290
Miss Mayune!

14:01.290 --> 14:04.350
Excuse me while I make my early exit!

14:06.690 --> 14:07.660
Look out!

14:12.100 --> 14:13.900
Kaoru! Mayune!

14:13.900 --> 14:15.700
We're all right.

14:17.170 --> 14:19.300
What's with these weird creatures?

14:22.240 --> 14:23.800
Are all of you all right?!

14:24.380 --> 14:27.180
Thank goodness! That was close.

14:27.180 --> 14:29.580
Himeno! There's no time for idle chat!

14:29.580 --> 14:30.640
Let's prét!

14:32.350 --> 14:33.580
What the?

14:33.580 --> 14:34.490
But...

14:34.490 --> 14:35.680
Hurry!

14:36.590 --> 14:37.650
Himeno?

14:38.420 --> 14:39.690
Don't come near me!

14:39.690 --> 14:41.230
No matter how much you wish it,

14:41.230 --> 14:42.790
...no matter how much you offer your heart to others,

14:42.790 --> 14:45.730
...you won't get anything in return, nor can you escape from sadness.

14:46.960 --> 14:49.170
You must have put up with a lot of suffering.

14:49.170 --> 14:51.570
You know nothing about me,

14:51.570 --> 14:53.800
...so don't pretend as though you understand.

14:54.570 --> 14:58.780
Everyone's the same. No one will look at the real me.

14:58.780 --> 15:01.210
Even you, you're the same.

15:01.880 --> 15:04.350
You're the same as me.

15:04.350 --> 15:07.690
At this very moment, you've lost sight of the sky to fly through...

15:07.690 --> 15:10.390
...and are resting your wings inside a cage.

15:10.390 --> 15:15.160
But if you stay in the cage forever, you will become unable to fly.

15:17.290 --> 15:21.000
You can still fly if you have a little courage.

15:21.000 --> 15:23.800
You haven't lost your wings yet.

15:23.800 --> 15:27.240
Do you plan on continuing to imprison your heart this way?

15:28.940 --> 15:29.930
Help...

15:30.840 --> 15:32.500
Help me...

15:33.740 --> 15:34.730
Come.

15:35.580 --> 15:37.480
Come with me.

15:37.480 --> 15:39.750
I'll set you free.

15:43.890 --> 15:44.980
Hurry, Himeno!

15:46.090 --> 15:46.990
Hajime!

15:49.830 --> 15:50.790
Himeno!

16:41.780 --> 16:42.880
All right!

16:42.880 --> 16:44.480
You're awesome, Himeno!

16:44.480 --> 16:46.720
Why were demon larvae in the Awayuki residence?

16:46.720 --> 16:49.050
Himeno went to the trouble to run away from home too.

16:49.990 --> 16:50.990
Run away from home?

16:50.990 --> 16:52.890
What's the meaning of this?!

16:52.890 --> 16:55.630
What the heck are you?!

16:55.630 --> 16:58.200
Sorry, it'll take a while to explain.

16:58.200 --> 17:00.100
More importantly, where's Mawata?

17:00.100 --> 17:01.690
Miss Mawata...

17:02.270 --> 17:03.490
Is here.

17:04.570 --> 17:05.540
Sasame!

17:05.540 --> 17:06.870
Mawata?

17:06.870 --> 17:08.540
What are you doing there?!

17:08.540 --> 17:11.180
It's dangerous! Come on down!

17:11.180 --> 17:12.840
Mawata!

17:13.580 --> 17:16.380
Sasame! What have you done to her?!

17:16.380 --> 17:21.290
Nothing, I only saved her from the darkness of solitude.

17:21.290 --> 17:22.590
Why you!

17:22.590 --> 17:23.980
Go!

17:22.990 --> 17:23.980
Sasame!

17:24.790 --> 17:25.890
Go!

17:25.890 --> 17:26.880
What's going on?!

17:27.590 --> 17:30.390
What's the meaning behind getting her involved, Sasame?!

17:30.390 --> 17:31.930
Return Mawata to us!

17:31.930 --> 17:35.630
Fine with me. That is, if that's what she wants.

17:36.670 --> 17:40.970
So you're oblivious after all, oblivious to how much she's been wounded.

17:40.970 --> 17:42.770
Thanks to you all, her family!

17:42.770 --> 17:44.580
What nonsense!

17:44.580 --> 17:48.980
That's exactly it! You didn't think about me, even a little bit!

17:48.980 --> 17:53.280
You're not my family. You are just strangers living in the same house!

17:54.080 --> 17:56.120
Mawata...

17:56.120 --> 17:57.520
What are you saying?

17:57.520 --> 18:01.360
It's not like you at all to say such childish things!

18:01.360 --> 18:03.560
Like me? What's that?

18:03.560 --> 18:05.860
You're my daughter, my pride and joy!

18:05.860 --> 18:09.970
I appreciate you greatly! You've encouraged me countless times!

18:09.970 --> 18:15.840
You always had it together, you're strong, you don't cry.

18:15.840 --> 18:18.000
There's no way such a girl exists!

18:18.980 --> 18:21.980
I wanted to cry but I couldn't!

18:21.980 --> 18:24.680
No matter how lonely I was, how sad I was...

18:24.680 --> 18:26.840
No one tried to understand!

18:27.990 --> 18:32.390
Ever since Father died, I was always, always...

18:32.390 --> 18:35.990
Always, always, always alone!

18:35.990 --> 18:37.330
Mawata...

18:37.330 --> 18:39.100
Mawata, I'm sorry!

18:39.100 --> 18:40.620
I don't care anymore.

18:41.630 --> 18:45.000
I have Sasame now. I'm not alone anymore.

18:45.870 --> 18:47.100
I'm not alone.

18:49.670 --> 18:51.330
Well done, Sasame.

18:52.180 --> 18:53.370
The Princess of Disaster!

18:55.880 --> 18:56.970
Sasame?!

19:01.520 --> 19:02.890
Sasame?

19:02.890 --> 19:05.050
What's going on? Who is she?

19:05.920 --> 19:08.150
So you don't seem to understand yet.

19:09.030 --> 19:10.330
Sasame?

19:10.330 --> 19:14.920
Miss Mawata, as promised, I'll set you free.

19:16.630 --> 19:17.970
Sasame?

19:17.970 --> 19:19.140
Stop...

19:19.140 --> 19:20.500
No!

19:39.460 --> 19:43.630
There isn't anyone who thinks of you as important.

19:43.630 --> 19:49.090
Just like me, sixteen years ago, you now have nothing.

19:50.630 --> 19:52.230
You poor child.

19:59.480 --> 20:00.880
Mawata!

20:00.880 --> 20:03.380
This is your heart.

20:03.380 --> 20:07.480
It's so beautiful, radiating the color of despair.

20:07.480 --> 20:09.990
And so, you'll be set free.

20:09.990 --> 20:13.590
Free from everything which made you suffer.

20:13.590 --> 20:16.290
Your heart, smeared in despair, will become a shell...

20:16.290 --> 20:19.920
...which will protect you from this tainted world of humans!

20:20.460 --> 20:21.400
Mawata!

20:22.170 --> 20:26.800
And this is the source of power for the Great Tree of Fenrir!

20:37.210 --> 20:39.650
What?! A big earthquake?

20:42.990 --> 20:44.780
What in the world is that?!

20:48.060 --> 20:48.820
Himeno!

20:51.330 --> 20:52.630
This is...

20:55.430 --> 20:56.330
Mawata?!

20:59.270 --> 21:02.940
It's no use. She can't hear anything now.

21:02.940 --> 21:06.030
She's become the nucleus of what will gather Leafe.

21:07.510 --> 21:09.880
And so, it has begun.

21:10.480 --> 21:12.470
The end of the world.

21:23.200 --> 21:28.900
Staring out the window of a room with the lights off

21:23.200 --> 21:28.900
akari o keshita heya no mado kara miru

21:28.900 --> 21:33.140
The stars shine in the night sky

21:28.900 --> 21:33.140
yozora ni hoshi ga hikaru

21:33.140 --> 21:39.010
Today will definitely be a search for your constellation

21:33.140 --> 21:39.010
kyo koso anata no seiza sagashi

21:39.010 --> 21:41.880
To give you an arbitrary jinx

21:39.010 --> 21:41.880
katte na jinkusu

21:41.880 --> 21:47.860
If you find the seventh star, then it's the Lucky Star

21:41.880 --> 21:47.860
nanatsume no hoshi o mitsuketara <i>Lucky</i> <i>Star</i>

21:47.860 --> 21:51.830
Tomorrow, with a happy face

21:47.860 --> 21:51.830
ashita wa egao de

21:51.830 --> 21:57.930
I'll greet you good morning

21:51.830 --> 21:57.930
ohayoutte koe o kakete ageru wa

21:57.930 --> 22:02.240
It's a special thing you can't do anything about

21:57.930 --> 22:02.240
shikatanai tokubetsu

22:02.240 --> 22:03.600
My Sweet Heart

22:02.240 --> 22:03.600
My Sweet Heart

22:03.600 --> 22:09.910
I can't be the only one engrossed in all of this

22:03.600 --> 22:09.910
watashi bakari ga muchuu da nante masaka

22:09.910 --> 22:13.680
It just can't be, and I won't stand for it

22:09.910 --> 22:13.680
arienai yurusenai

22:13.680 --> 22:20.690
I want to see what you're feeling in your heart

22:13.680 --> 22:20.690
anata no naka no kimochi nozokitai

22:20.690 --> 22:29.030
To do it secretly, without you knowing

22:20.690 --> 22:29.030
kizukarenai you ni naisho de

22:40.870 --> 22:43.970
Himeno, I'll bring your smile back to your face.

22:43.970 --> 22:44.780
Hayate...

22:44.780 --> 22:46.610
In addition...

22:46.610 --> 22:50.380
When this battle's over, there's something I want to tell you.

22:47.410 --> 22:50.380
Warmth, Once More
